    "Starting cards as marked '(st)': Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Wise Advice and Do, Or Do Not; they count toward the 60 (total 60 as published). Several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty; no starting location is marked, so starting.card is left empty.",
